var string[] MACRO_CAUSE = array.from("If Social Security borrowing headlines persist through Q3 without benefit cuts,…", "If strikes persist through Q3 2026, central banks may front-load gold purchases,…", "Gold tests resistance as haven flows intensify. Silver lags on industrial drag.…", "copper copper, Gold, XAUUSD — Copper catches bid, gold-bond divergence tightens, stocks chop.", "GDX rises as wealthy advisors rotate taxable gains out of tech and into gold ahead…", "Pension funds dump IWM rate-cut beta; money rotates to TLT, QQQ. PA, PL,…", "If strikes persist through Q3 2026, central banks may front-load gold purchases,…", "If strikes persist through Q3 2026, central banks may front-load gold purchases,…", "copper copper, Gold, XAUUSD — Copper catches bid, gold-bond divergence tightens, stocks chop.", "If markup clears by October, forced Q4 rebalancing from trusts may re-rate GDX as a…", "intermediate bonds, dollar, EURUSD — Trend funds cover Treasury shorts,…", "Long bonds breathe as gold pivots to inflation hedge. Euro reprices energy-tax drag. Defense rerates.", "Ueda signals further BOJ hikes, putting yen carry and gold haven flows in play.", "NZDUSD grinds lower as the kiwi-yen rate gap closes even with stable dairy prices supporting…", "KC — If the Oman backchannel stalls and escort operations stretch into late summer,…", "If reshoring metrics keep improving, investors may treat CNH as a currency to short,…", "Growth fund managers may rotate into IWM's tech and component names if hardware pilot announcements…", "If Trump's deregulation keeps rolling through H2 2026,…", "Credit grind bleeds into small-cap stress. TLT rallies as clean duration play.…", "Trapped workers and collapsed buildings halt production at Kumamoto industrial sites.…", "Shelly's €400–500M currency exposure becomes a live risk as dollar strength persists against emerging-market …", "NEM, silver, XLRE — CTA gold stops trigger, GDX futures forced selling hits miners", "Sticky long yields